### Asset Diagnostics — Market Data API
### Extensão VS Code: humao.rest-client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333
@fiiSymbol = CACR11
@stockSymbol = PETR4
@secondaryFiiSymbol = MXRF11

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Diagnóstico completo de um FII
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/assets?symbols={{fiiSymbol}}
Accept: application/json

### Diagnóstico completo de múltiplos ativos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/assets?symbols={{fiiSymbol}},{{secondaryFiiSymbol}},{{stockSymbol}}
Accept: application/json

### Diagnóstico via POST
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/assets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "symbols": ["{{fiiSymbol}}", "{{secondaryFiiSymbol}}", "{{stockSymbol}}"]
}

### Pré-condição recomendada para FIIs — sincronizar documentos
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/sync
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "symbols": ["{{fiiSymbol}}", "{{secondaryFiiSymbol}}"]
}

### Pré-condição recomendada para FIIs — sincronizar eventos/proventos
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events/sync
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "symbols": ["{{fiiSymbol}}", "{{secondaryFiiSymbol}}"]
}

### Pré-condição recomendada — sincronizar logos
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/logos/sync
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "symbols": ["{{fiiSymbol}}", "{{secondaryFiiSymbol}}", "{{stockSymbol}}"]
}

### Conferir proventos de referência
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/income/{{fiiSymbol}}?years=5&limit=120
Accept: application/json

### Conferir contexto de IA factual
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/{{fiiSymbol}}/ai-context
Accept: application/json
